## QUESTION: READ REPLICA KYA HAI?
------------------------------------

Read Replica ek additional database instance/node hota hai jo Primary
Database ke data ki replicated copy maintain karta hai.

Primary DB par writes perform hoti hain, jabki Read Replicas
primarily read requests handle karti hain.

Read Replicas ka primary purpose hai read workload ko
multiple database nodes ke across distribute karna,
taaki Primary DB par read load kam ho aur read latency
improve ho sake.

Primary DB usually Source of Truth hota hai, yani latest aur correct data
Primary DB mein maana jaata hai.

                         
